~ start

Nyan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], nice to meet you.
Nyan: Welcome to your new farm.
Nyan: As you can see, the cows and chickens are hungry.
Nyan: We need to grow some crops before we can help the village.

- Take crop seeds
    Teemo: I'm ready to help.
    do GameDialogueManager.action_give_crop_seeds()
    do QuestManager.start_quest("first_harvest")

- Maybe later
    Teemo: I'll come back when I'm ready.

=> END


~ progress

Nyan: Keep growing Corn.
Nyan: Bring me 5 Corn when you're finished.

=> END


~ turn_in

Nyan: Wonderful!
Nyan: These crops will help feed our animals.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Nyan: Thank you.
Nyan: Please accept this reward.

=> END


~ completed

Nyan: Thanks again for your help.
Nyan: Let's continue restoring Harvestia together.

=> END